ha Krishn fearlessly.\nThus, abandoning all expectations from various kinds of spiritual practises, the mind is exclusively dedicated towards the dust of Vrindavan, while residing in the same dust!\nShri Anandghan says that while drenching with same nectar forever, thus get the triumph of your life.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5d8f9e1789c4660060055dfe/jo-kou-vrindavan-basi-jaanai-shri-anandghan-ji","author":"श्री आनँदघन जी, पदावली  (692)","status":"published","content_text":"$8","tags":"$9","image_urls":"$a","video_urls":"$b","media_links":"$c","source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5d8f9e1789c4660060055dfe/jo-kou-vrindavan-basi-jaanai-shri-anandghan-ji","slug":"jo-kuo-vrindavan-basi-janai"}
